71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7XmbpLnsovsQ7kNvwHowPe1&_nc_oc=AdpDjnLyHbfOCko0Z4yFzYdISucSHNv8qPx7bTMqYwOf20wLBF91UAGaUFSb0QpJu5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9gAFA7Jn8KFYVWM35LD850x8la6Q2Oy66sptvpjWUSdg&oe=6A3D28B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVMMeozSUh0Q7kNvwHdGl4y&_nc_oc=AdqzsqO70PscZnkjD-CYuQ0ddpH05XFJjjaD_SrGiAoIOj5BmEEJb9GkMkTe2mUdgQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Gd7HMvriWHQr6Iu_Hbmj84PN65vE5fF_cNA6CnL6jUQ&oe=6A3D3B93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fViAdLB3aIcQ7kNvwGYLGxc&_nc_oc=AdohUTnhZRRpbof770Cr2CRZC1-sJZwE3UPKfc2Qpq1hmrjcmwjMEGkJLmTB0kF4iEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8E74dlDcxPYzNmxaTqqmzZesWPqkQ5lDGqDSJaBB6Ifg&oe=6A3D39DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: